{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03955","headline":"奉和九月九日圣制登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和九月九日圣制登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞塔云霄半，清晨羽斾游。\n登临凭季月，寥廓见中州。\n御酒新寒退，天文瑞景留。\n辟邪将献寿，兹日奉千秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}